      "notes": "Mailbox login is NOT entered in this JSON file. Create an n8n credential first: Credentials → New → Microsoft Outlook OAuth2 API → sign in as BeAware@tpcentralodisha.com (or an account with delegated/shared-mailbox access). Then open this node and select the credential named \"BeAware Outlook OAuth2 Credential\". This trigger polls unread Inbox messages addressed to BeAware@tpcentralodisha.com in To or Cc."
