    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## BeAware mailbox credential setup\n\nDo **not** paste the mailbox password into this workflow JSON. n8n stores mailbox login details in **Credentials**.\n\n1. In n8n, go to **Credentials → New**.\n2. Choose **Microsoft Outlook OAuth2 API**.\n3. Name it **BeAware Outlook OAuth2 Credential**.\n4. Sign in with **BeAware@tpcentralodisha.com**, or with a Microsoft 365 account that has delegated/shared-mailbox access to it.\n5. Open **Outlook Trigger - BeAware Inbox** and select that credential.\n6. Open **Send Result** and select the same credential if this workflow should send from the BeAware mailbox.\n\nThis workflow only references the credential by name/id; the actual OAuth token is created and encrypted by n8n at runtime.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "name": "How to connect BeAware mailbox credentials",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
